Sklyanka

Sklyanka is a medication tracker for Android. It is not a medical device: it does
not give treatment recommendations, does not select dosages and does not check
drug interactions. Nothing in this repository is medical advice.

Health data entered into the app is stored on the device of its user. The
repository contains no user data.

